# public/data/* is intentionally TRACKED in git so the bot can commit
# synced artefacts. The .github/workflows/sync-from-dea-metamodel.yml
# workflow owns these files; hand-edits will be overwritten by the bot
# on the next sync. See that workflow's "Detect hand-edits" step for
# how drift is flagged.
